runtime/cheats.c: the cheat file parser, Atmosphère's dmnt cheat VM (opcodes 0-A, C0-C4, FF0/FF1/FFF),
the player's cheat files in <data>/cheats (import a <build id>.txt or a database zip; on / off by name).
runtime/hle/cheats_rt.c: loaded at boot, the master code and the cheats that are on run as one program each
frame (input_frame) with the buttons held; writes into code / read-only data refused, code-patching cheats
skipped. Launcher: a Cheats tab on the Mods page (import, tick boxes, code patches greyed out).

